Error [E0334]: `add` doesn't take a trailing block
  --> tests/ui/trailing_block_not_function.jet:6:12
    |
  6 |     add(1) {
    |            ^
 Why: a trailing `{ }` block fills a last argument that is a function taking no parameters; this call's last parameter is Int (a whole number)
 Fix: pass it inside the parentheses, or give the function a zero-parameter last argument
